WEBVTT

00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:08.200
Stay back, Yuki.

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:10.520
It's Reiga.

00:00:32.030 --> 00:00:35.020
Kanata-san...

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:44.230
Kanata-san is Reiga?

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:51.790
Only I know your pain...

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:54.290
Your uncertainty...

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:57.210
Your loneliness...

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:02.300
If only we could be together forever.

00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:08.760
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:18.980
I will not betray you!

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:03.950
The Irony of Fate

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:22.890
Reiga-sama...

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:50.140
He's...

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:55.560
Kanata-san...

00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:00.800
You're Kanata-san, aren't you?

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:06.050
I've abandoned the name Wakamiya Kanata.

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:10.260
Wakamiya Kanata?

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:13.230
He's Reiga?

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:19.240
No... Impossible.

00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:24.410
Say that's untrue, Kanata-san!

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:25.620
Kanata-san!

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:30.550
Stay away from him, Yuki.

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:32.250
It's true.

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:36.000
That's Reiga.

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:40.190
No... Why?

00:04:40.870 --> 00:04:41.970
But...

00:04:42.710 --> 00:04:45.500
We were together only a moment ago.

00:04:47.030 --> 00:04:50.770
You were still the Kanata-san I know!

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:54.480
You know nothing.

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:59.400
That Walpurgis Night,

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:04.610
it was I who called those Duras and
commanded them to attack you.

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:16.550
At the time, it took all my effort
to command a Mid-Villain.

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:22.010
I thought, given a night as
favorable as Walpurgis Night,

00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:25.150
I'd be able to kill you.

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:30.140
But things didn't go as planned...

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:34.520
Kill me?

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:44.850
What? Reiga was reborn with Yuki?

00:05:45.430 --> 00:05:49.470
These two met before the fighting started.

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:52.410
I can't stand this.

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:57.330
Aren't you Yuki's friend?

00:05:57.980 --> 00:05:59.960
Have you been lying this whole time?

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:03.880
Did you always plan to betray Yuki?

00:06:11.630 --> 00:06:13.510
What did I tell you, Yuki?

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:16.350
You shouldn't be so trusting.

00:06:17.300 --> 00:06:20.190
People betray people.

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:23.070
Betray...

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:29.410
People... People betray people.

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:36.030
There are those who will not betray you.

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:42.840
I will not betray Yuki.

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:55.470
How ludicrous!
Zess, you and I are the same.

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:59.940
You betrayed your family and
allied yourself with the Giou Clan.

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:03.440
Are you claiming you wouldn't do it again?

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:09.060
Please stop.

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:15.410
Kanata-san would never
say something like that.

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:19.160
Stop hurting the people I love!

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:26.950
I've warned you several times already.

00:07:35.490 --> 00:07:39.000
Stay out of this battle, Yuki.

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:43.560
I'd hoped you would listen to me.

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:45.860
Kanata-san?

00:07:52.270 --> 00:07:53.410
Yuki!

00:07:53.690 --> 00:07:55.120
Go, Fenrir.

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:01.750
Luka!

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:05.210
Sodom!

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:09.330
Yuki!

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:12.170
Let's go!

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:14.360
Can't let you do that!

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:16.720
I still have to thank you for
what you did to my arm!

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:32.240
Damn.

00:08:47.810 --> 00:08:48.790
Yuki!

00:08:55.320 --> 00:08:59.520
Fenrir's power rivals an Opast's.

00:09:00.460 --> 00:09:04.560
Even he will be trapped in there for a while.

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:06.150
That book...

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:11.610
That time...

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:18.030
I was Wakamiya Kanata and Giou Reiga then.

00:09:19.650 --> 00:09:24.540
But now I am your enemy!

00:09:26.050 --> 00:09:28.630
Is this a dream?

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:37.260
This is reality, Yuki.

00:09:43.530 --> 00:09:44.810
No.

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:50.310
Say it's not true!

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:54.020
Then hate me, Yuki.

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:56.780
Hate me

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:58.530
and die!

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:21.830
You're late, as usual, Takashiro.

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:28.220
And you were late to awaken, Reiga.

00:10:30.570 --> 00:10:32.130
Takashiro-san!

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:34.730
I'm fine.

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:46.250
Takashiro's here?

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:47.160
Yes.

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:04.970
Takashiro...

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:09.600
Reiga, I will stop you!

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:13.730
Stop me?

00:11:16.310 --> 00:11:20.110
If you intend to stand in my way,
you must have learned nothing.

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:23.570
It is the Giou Clan's destiny.

00:11:25.110 --> 00:11:27.580
That sounds just like you, Takashiro.

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:34.540
But it isn't yours, is it?

00:11:39.990 --> 00:11:44.210
Takashiro, you cannot stop me.

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:48.720
Not now and not ever.

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:51.150
Kanata-san.

00:11:51.880 --> 00:11:56.270
Yuki, I will kill you.

00:12:03.310 --> 00:12:06.870
Zess... Back so soon?

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:15.750
Yuki! Yuki!

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:19.250
Move, Takashiro!

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:21.760
I'll kill him!

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:25.410
Take Yuki and stand back.

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:29.170
I won't be able to hold back.

00:12:29.170 --> 00:12:33.350
Even if my opponent is an old friend.

00:12:34.430 --> 00:12:35.930
Your friend?

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:38.940
Prepare yourself, Reiga!

00:12:45.010 --> 00:12:46.330
<i>Lufen!</i>

00:12:48.210 --> 00:12:51.040
I am the keeper of <i>The Key of Solomon</i>.

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:54.160
I am the keeper of <i>The Key of Raziel</i>.

00:12:57.020 --> 00:13:01.090
I call upon the ancient contract
to open the gates of eternity.

00:13:05.820 --> 00:13:08.950
I am the master of thought.

00:13:08.950 --> 00:13:13.680
A necromancer, I call upon thee.

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:18.280
He who bears the burden of
the jewel in his forehead,

00:13:18.280 --> 00:13:23.090
he who dwells in the abyss
blacker than darkness.

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:28.530
Hear my call and obey my will!

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:30.280
Come, Nidhogg!

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:32.040
Come, Vouivre!

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:52.390
Yuki, let's leave.

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:55.310
Yuki!

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:03.330
<i>I've abandoned the name
Wakamiya Kanata.</i>

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:07.480
<i>Yuki, I will kill you.</i>

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:13.800
The man standing there is not Kanata-san.

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:21.580
Yuki?

00:14:24.070 --> 00:14:25.170
Yuki...

00:14:30.730 --> 00:14:33.390
Damn it! Sneaking around like that!

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:36.600
Sorry to make you wait, Hotsuma.

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:39.610
Okay!

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:44.770
Where'd this sphere come from?

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:50.410
You're trapped!

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:54.370
Wh-What?

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:56.700
Damn it, you bastard!

00:14:57.300 --> 00:14:58.900
Mission accomplished.

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:04.630
This ends now!

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:13.750
Jekyll...

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:20.020
Damn it!

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:36.060
He who tears at the dead,

00:15:36.730 --> 00:15:39.450
he who dwells by Yggdrasil's roots.

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:45.710
As my frozen sword,
slay these creatures of Earth.

00:15:55.720 --> 00:16:00.680
Kanata-san and Takashiro-san are fighting...

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:13.110
It seems your abilities haven't decayed,
but this use of energy isn't like you.

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:20.070
I know your powers have yet to fully awaken.

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:25.080
It's been a while since I saw
that fire in your eyes.

00:16:35.960 --> 00:16:40.770
You must remember it every
time you see those scars.

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:47.690
I'll show you just how powerless, in this
endless battle, you are, Takashiro!

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:59.550
I've only looked back on one scene.

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:06.600
The sight of your bloodied figure

00:17:08.180 --> 00:17:11.500
in that sea of fire!

00:17:28.870 --> 00:17:29.940
Why...

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:33.440
Why do these two...

00:17:37.730 --> 00:17:39.160
It's over, Reiga!

00:17:49.950 --> 00:17:51.560
Please stop!

00:18:10.530 --> 00:18:11.620
Yuki...

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:20.080
Please stop.

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:23.150
Why...

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:27.020
Why do you have to fight?

00:18:28.490 --> 00:18:33.210
Kanata-san, was that really the truth?

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:37.420
Were you lying to me this whole time?

00:18:42.820 --> 00:18:44.380
It's not true, right?

00:18:44.780 --> 00:18:47.210
The words you said...

00:18:47.210 --> 00:18:48.510
That smile...

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:53.480
They weren't all lies, were they?

00:18:57.000 --> 00:19:03.700
Yuki, don't believe everything
Takashiro tells you.

00:19:12.840 --> 00:19:14.690
Are you okay?

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:26.870
I won't let you get away!

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:29.770
Leave him.

00:19:35.090 --> 00:19:36.440
Kanata-san.

00:19:37.540 --> 00:19:39.360
If I had...

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:41.110
<i>Come home with me.</i>

00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:44.910
If I had agreed to go with you...

00:19:45.190 --> 00:19:47.450
<i>Don't go! Stay with me!</i>

00:19:48.050 --> 00:19:51.960
If I had seen what was in your heart...

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:02.670
Kanata-san!

00:20:03.320 --> 00:20:04.860
Goodbye,

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:06.980
Yuki.

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:48.050
Does it hurt?

00:20:54.060 --> 00:21:00.730
Pain, pain, fly away!
Pain, pain, fly away!

00:21:27.280 --> 00:21:28.260
Yuki.

00:21:29.000 --> 00:21:30.350
Kanata-san...

00:21:32.280 --> 00:21:35.430
Kanata-san... Kanata-san.

00:21:38.820 --> 00:21:40.110
Kanata-san...

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:55.690
Kanata-san!

00:22:00.390 --> 00:22:03.090
Goodbye, Yuki.

00:23:35.430 --> 00:23:36.800
Listen to this, Yuki-chan!

00:23:36.800 --> 00:23:41.840
Tsukumo's not done with his club activities, even though
it's the anniversary of our first movie together!

00:23:41.840 --> 00:23:43.340
Today's that anniversary?

00:23:43.340 --> 00:23:45.740
Yeah! Tomorrow's the anniversary of our first time
doing laundry together, and the day after that...

00:23:45.740 --> 00:23:46.770
Bound by Contract

00:23:46.770 --> 00:23:48.430
Every day's an anniversary.

00:23:48.430 --> 00:23:49.520
Yeah!
Bound by Contract

00:23:49.520 --> 00:23:49.590
Bound by Contract
